264
00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:35.284
No.

265
00:23:37.997 --> 00:23:40.625
Have your dad sign it,
get it back to me,

266
00:23:40.699 --> 00:23:42.826
deadline's in two weeks.

267
00:23:44.403 --> 00:23:45.734
Danny...

268
00:23:48.073 --> 00:23:49.506
ignore them.

269
00:23:51.277 --> 00:23:53.677
Your dad was one
hell of a racer.

270
00:23:58.818 --> 00:24:01.378
♪ ♪

271
00:24:01.454 --> 00:24:03.979
