272
00:24:04.056 --> 00:24:07.184
(Parker) Okay, now for all
the new faces out there,

273
00:24:07.259 --> 00:24:08.886
I'd like to welcome
you to Drama Class.

274
00:24:08.961 --> 00:24:11.987
I am Miss Parker. And,
I like to start each new

275
00:24:12.064 --> 00:24:15.830
class with an exercise that
I call 'First lmpressions'.

276
00:24:15.901 --> 00:24:18.563
So, which one of you
is going to go first?

277
00:24:19.472 --> 00:24:23.738
Uh huh, uh huh.
Okay, you in the back.

278
00:24:25.244 --> 00:24:27.474
