279
00:24:27.546 --> 00:24:28.308
Danny.

280
00:24:28.781 --> 00:24:31.306
Danny? Will you
stand right here?

281
00:24:31.383 --> 00:24:33.647
Ah, and who would
like to give us their

282
00:24:33.719 --> 00:24:35.914
first impression of Danny?

283
00:24:35.988 --> 00:24:37.250
Jessica.

284
00:24:38.557 --> 00:24:41.151
You seem like you have
a lot to say today.

285
00:24:41.894 --> 00:24:43.691
