me what you see?

286
00:24:46.799 --> 00:24:48.824
He's definitely a
transfer student.

287
00:24:48.901 --> 00:24:50.869
Okay, interesting.
Continue.

288
00:24:50.936 --> 00:24:54.064
He is probably in Drama
because it's the

289
00:24:54.139 --> 00:24:55.367
