290
00:24:55.441 --> 00:24:56.772
And, why do you say that?

291
00:24:56.842 --> 00:24:58.810
He doesn't look like the kind
of guy who reads Shakespeare.

292
00:24:58.878 --> 00:25:01.711
(huffs) Neither do you,
Miss Popularity,

293
00:25:01.780 --> 00:25:03.304
in your four
hundred dollar jeans.

294
00:25:04.183 --> 00:25:05.878
Name one character
