grader knows that.

297
00:25:10.155 --> 00:25:12.953
You said any character.
Your turn.

298
00:25:14.193 --> 00:25:16.423
Oh, this is really difficult,
I mean there are so many

299
00:25:16.495 --> 00:25:21.626
