474
00:37:30.329 --> 00:37:32.024
There we go, rice burner.

475
00:37:37.236 --> 00:37:38.601
Pull over, Kruger!

476
00:37:38.671 --> 00:37:39.695
Come on.

477
00:37:43.042 --> 00:37:44.373
