780
00:59:11.363 --> 00:59:12.853
you screw up. Give me your
keys, you're done driving.

781
00:59:12.932 --> 00:59:14.160
You're done driving.

782
00:59:14.233 --> 00:59:17.031
You know what I think,
I think you're jealous, cause

783
00:59:17.102 --> 00:59:19.832
I've got a real shot at doing
something that you never could.

784
00:59:19.905 --> 00:59:22.601
Give me your keys.
Give me your keys!

785
00:59:46.165 --> 00:59:47.359
(knocking)

786
00:59:50.069 --> 00:59:52.503
Hi, ah...

787
00:59:53.606 --> 00:59:54.903
is Jessica here?

788
00:59:56.742 --> 00:59:59.108
What do you want, Danny?

789
01:00:01.880 --> 01:00:04.940
I screwed up, but l
didn't go there to race.

790
01:00:05.017 --> 01:00:06.450
Then why were you there?

791
01:00:06.518 --> 01:00:08.486
Oh, I needed to see what l
was up against in the drags.

792
01:00:08.554 --> 01:00:09.885
Why couldn't you
just tell me that?

793
01:00:09.955 --> 01:00:11.149
I don't know.

794
01:00:15.694 --> 01:00:19.960
Back in L.A., I had a
sponsorship, a really big one,

795
01:00:20.032 --> 01:00:22.091
and I lost it.

796
01:00:22.167 --> 01:00:23.293
How?

797
01:00:23.369 --> 01:00:25.303
It doesn't matter how.

798
01:00:25.904 --> 01:00:28.702
When I heard about the High School
Drags, I thought...

799
01:00:28.774 --> 01:00:31.971
this could be my shot, you
know, like my second chance.

800
01:00:32.044 --> 01:00:34.035
So, am I just something
to pass the time with

801
01:00:34.113 --> 01:00:36.138
until you get that
golden ticket out of here?

802
01:00:36.215 --> 01:00:37.807
No, no, not at all.

803
01:00:37.883 --> 01:00:39.282
Have you ever stopped
to think that just maybe

804
01:00:39.351 --> 01:00:41.182
there are more important
things than racing?

805
01:00:41.253 --> 01:00:43.084
I came here to apologize
to you, why are you

806
01:00:43.155 --> 01:00:44.850
giving me a hard time?

807
01:00:44.923 --> 01:00:48.086
If that's how you feel,
then you need to go.

808
01:00:49.928 --> 01:00:51.225
Are you serious?

809
01:00:51.296 --> 01:00:52.786
Now.

810
01:01:06.078 --> 01:01:07.943
(dripping)

811
01:01:20.793 --> 01:01:23.318
♪ ♪

812
01:01:58.797 --> 01:02:00.424
(squealing tires)

813
01:02:02.334 --> 01:02:03.733
(crash)

814
01:02:22.855 --> 01:02:25.915
(phone rings)

815
01:02:27.960 --> 01:02:28.619
Yeah?

816
01:02:28.694 --> 01:02:31.356
Dad, I need your help.

817
01:02:33.432 --> 01:02:35.024
Where are you?

818
01:02:47.846 --> 01:02:48.870
Are you okay?

819
01:02:48.947 --> 01:02:49.675
Yeah.

820
01:02:49.748 --> 01:02:50.578
Are you okay?

821
01:02:50.649 --> 01:02:51.638
I'm fine.

822
01:02:52.885 --> 01:02:53.749
Are you sure?

823
01:02:54.119 --> 01:02:55.552
I'm fine.

824
01:03:02.961 --> 01:03:05.088
Oh man.
What happened?

825
01:03:06.031 --> 01:03:08.056
Somebody messed with my brakes.

826
01:03:15.174 --> 01:03:17.734
You had to be hauling
ass to end up like that.

827
01:03:17.810 --> 01:03:20.005
I'm telling you, somebody
screwed with my car.

828
01:03:22.080 --> 01:03:24.378
Always somebody
else's fault with you.

829
01:03:25.784 --> 01:03:27.809
You could have gotten
yourself killed.

830
01:03:27.886 --> 01:03:29.410
You don't think.

831
01:03:30.522 --> 01:03:32.922
What the hell's wrong with you?

832
01:03:35.661 --> 01:03:37.253
Ohhh.

833
01:03:42.602 --> 01:03:44.365
Help me with the winch.

834
01:03:47.607 --> 01:03:48.801
(dials)

835
01:03:51.411 --> 01:03:54.278
(phone rings)

836
01:03:57.350 --> 01:03:58.544
Hello.

837
01:04:00.019 --> 01:04:01.179
Mom?

838
01:04:02.055 --> 01:04:03.352
Danny?

839
01:04:04.424 --> 01:04:06.153
Can I come home?

840
01:04:07.460 --> 01:04:09.155
Oh, Danny.

841
01:04:12.765 --> 01:04:16.531
If, if I thought this
wasn't the best thing for you,

842
01:04:16.603 --> 01:04:19.094
I would come and
get you in a heart beat.

843
01:04:20.006 --> 01:04:21.997
(crying)

844
01:04:22.075 --> 01:04:26.409
He hates me, he doesn't want
me here, he never wanted me.

845
01:04:26.479 --> 01:04:29.073
No, no, that is not true.

846
01:04:29.148 --> 01:04:31.616
It was his idea for
you to go there.

847
01:04:32.752 --> 01:04:35.846
Danny, talk to him.
He loves you.

848
01:04:36.823 --> 01:04:38.916
Maybe it's time to forgive him.

849
01:04:42.061 --> 01:04:43.961
Oh, I'm sorry, Mom.

850
01:04:45.598 --> 01:04:46.656
I know.

851
01:04:49.035 --> 01:04:50.195
I love you.

852
01:04:51.237 --> 01:04:52.670
I love you, too.

853
01:05:21.634 --> 01:05:23.659
Why did you leave?

854
01:05:34.580 --> 01:05:37.674
Ah, I fell apart,
I ruined everything,

855
01:05:37.750 --> 01:05:39.911
trying to make an impossible
path instead of finishing

856
01:05:39.986 --> 01:05:42.921
second and having a
family and a career.

857
01:05:51.230 --> 01:05:52.561
Hey...

858
01:05:55.301 --> 01:05:58.668
do you remember the time I came to pick
you up from school...

859
01:05:58.738 --> 01:06:01.639
right before l, I took off?

860
01:06:02.942 --> 01:06:04.170
No.

861
01:06:04.243 --> 01:06:07.178
You had a 104-degree fever,

862
01:06:07.914 --> 01:06:10.508
the school nurse called
for us to pick you up.

863
01:06:11.985 --> 01:06:15.284
Mom was at work, I didn't
have a job because l...

864
01:06:17.724 --> 01:06:19.453
well, when I got there...

865
01:06:23.029 --> 01:06:25.224
they wouldn't release you to me.

866
01:06:25.298 --> 01:06:27.732
I mean it wasn't even
10:30 in the morning,

867
01:06:27.800 --> 01:06:30.428
and I was already
half a bottle in.

868
01:06:32.071 --> 01:06:33.698
I don't remember that.

869
01:06:40.013 --> 01:06:42.174
You know what I do remember?

870
01:06:43.249 --> 01:06:46.309
It was the first time you took me for a
ride in this beast.

871
01:06:47.520 --> 01:06:50.080
I had butterflies in my
stomach the whole time.

872
01:06:50.556 --> 01:06:53.525
That feeling of
acceleration was so intense,

873
01:06:53.593 --> 01:06:57.620
I was really scared
at first, then I felt safe.

874
01:06:59.665 --> 01:07:01.997
Cause I knew you were
behind the wheel.

875
01:07:09.675 --> 01:07:10.972
You know what...

876
01:07:12.512 --> 01:07:14.742
as hard as it is to hear it,

877
01:07:15.915 --> 01:07:19.578
I'm glad I mean it's better that I wasn't
there for the last few

878
01:07:19.652 --> 01:07:23.088
years, cause it wasn't pretty and you'd
hate me even more.

879
01:07:23.156 --> 01:07:26.387
I didn't hate you.
I never hated you.

880
01:07:27.527 --> 01:07:31.861
But, you know, a
visit every once in a

881
01:07:31.931 --> 01:07:33.922
while would have been nice.

882
01:07:35.902 --> 01:07:38.769
Yeah, I should have been there.

883
01:08:00.860 --> 01:08:03.420
Thanks. I'll get a
ride home from Max.

884
01:08:09.168 --> 01:08:12.228
Hey Kruger, where's your ride?

885
01:08:12.305 --> 01:08:13.772
Working on any new mods?

886
01:08:13.840 --> 01:08:15.398
It's wrecked, you guys.

887
01:08:15.475 --> 01:08:16.339
I'm out.

888
01:08:16.409 --> 01:08:18.377
(school bell)

889
01:08:21.848 --> 01:08:23.440
Where's Fernando?

890
01:08:23.516 --> 01:08:26.110
He's supposed to be up there
playing Ben, I need a Ben.

891
01:08:26.185 --> 01:08:27.675
He's in the bathroom.

892
01:08:27.753 --> 01:08:29.220
Are you kidding me?

893
01:08:29.288 --> 01:08:30.812
I'll do it.

894
01:08:32.492 --> 01:08:33.754
Oh.

895
01:08:34.260 --> 01:08:35.386
Huh.

896
01:08:37.964 --> 01:08:40.899
Nice to see you
coming around, Danny.

897
01:08:43.002 --> 01:08:45.903
All right, you know what,
before you just jump in,

898
01:08:45.972 --> 01:08:48.634
I want you to tell me in
your own words, what do

899
01:08:48.708 --> 01:08:51.541
you think that Ben is
trying to say to Claire?

900
01:08:53.212 --> 01:08:54.543
Ahhh...

901
01:08:54.614 --> 01:08:56.980
All right, just remember,
he's a compulsive gambler

902
01:08:57.049 --> 01:08:59.540
and he just bet everything
on the wrong horse,

903
01:08:59.619 --> 01:09:01.416
and now he has to face her.

904
01:09:01.487 --> 01:09:04.047
(Danny) I guess he's...
saying he's sorry.

905
01:09:04.123 --> 01:09:05.215
Sorry?

906
01:09:05.291 --> 01:09:08.556
Dan... He just gambled
away her wedding ring,

907
01:09:08.628 --> 01:09:11.028
you're going to have to do
better than, I'm sorry.

908
01:09:11.097 --> 01:09:15.932
Ahh...
he'd say he was stupid,

909
01:09:16.002 --> 01:09:19.870
and that he let his addiction get the best
of him.

910
01:09:19.939 --> 01:09:22.567
(Parker) Good. What else?

911
01:09:22.642 --> 01:09:24.872
He'd say he should have
listened when she

912
01:09:24.944 --> 01:09:28.402
tried to help him,
and he'd say thank you.

913
01:09:29.382 --> 01:09:30.815
You're welcome.

914
01:09:38.791 --> 01:09:42.818
♪ ♪

915
01:09:55.875 --> 01:09:59.675
Well, that's a familiar
sight, I can't remember

916
01:09:59.745 --> 01:10:01.303
the last time I saw
you driving it.

917
01:10:01.380 --> 01:10:03.348
Ah, just thought l'd
dust her off and take

918
01:10:03.416 --> 01:10:04.906
my son to school today.

919
01:10:04.984 --> 01:10:06.952
I guess you heard our
boys got a little rowdy

920
01:10:07.019 --> 01:10:09.749
the other night, just like we
used to, except of course ah,

921
01:10:09.822 --> 01:10:11.084
Kendall won this time.

922
01:10:11.157 --> 01:10:12.488
Heard it was close.

923
01:10:12.558 --> 01:10:14.526
Ah, your boy didn't
have much of a chance.

924
01:10:14.594 --> 01:10:16.926
Got half my shop
bolted under Jake's V8.

925
01:10:16.996 --> 01:10:18.088
It'd end up lower, next.

926
01:10:18.164 --> 01:10:19.188
(Frank) Uh huh.

927
01:10:19.966 --> 01:10:22.764
It's good for business.
When he wins.

928
01:10:22.835 --> 01:10:24.632
All the other kids come in and
they spend all their money.

929
01:10:24.704 --> 01:10:25.864
Right.

930
01:10:28.274 --> 01:10:30.139
Hey, you know, l, I'm not
really sure that your

931
01:10:30.209 --> 01:10:33.372
boy's got much of a future
in racing, but hey...

932
01:10:33.446 --> 01:10:37.678
you can always change the name
of that shop to Kruger and Son.

933
01:10:39.585 --> 01:10:44.352
Ah, you know something, Jimmy,
it's one thing to understand

934
01:10:44.423 --> 01:10:47.392
how to bolt after market
parts to your car...

935
01:10:49.262 --> 01:10:51.423
It's another thing entirely...

936
01:10:52.565 --> 01:10:56.160
to understand how they
all work together.

937
01:10:56.235 --> 01:10:58.294
♪ ♪

938
01:11:46.819 --> 01:11:48.844
(laughs)

939
01:11:59.565 --> 01:12:01.260
Son of ah...

940
01:12:13.145 --> 01:12:16.273
Hey kid, what's going on?

941
01:12:16.349 --> 01:12:18.408
Remember guys, it's the last
day to turn in your permission

942
01:12:18.484 --> 01:12:21.180
