them if you got them.

943
01:12:36.535 --> 01:12:38.730
I'm glad you're still in.

944
01:12:47.313 --> 01:12:49.577
You guys want to be
part of my pit crew?

945
01:12:49.648 --> 01:12:51.377
Hell, yeah.

946
01:12:54.520 --> 01:12:56.852
We got three days boys,
so let's get this front

947
01:12:56.922 --> 01:12:59.152
end stripped,
I mean everything.

948
01:12:59.225 --> 01:13:01.693
Could you guys use
another pair of hands?

949
01:13:06.832 --> 01:13:08.163
Thank you.

950
01:13:08.234 --> 01:13:11.294
Two fenders, front cross member,
radiator supports, two A arms,

951
01:13:11.370 --> 01:13:15.431
inter cooler, motor mounts and
the grand total is...

952
01:13:16.242 --> 01:13:19.439
There's no way, it's too much.

953
01:13:24.917 --> 01:13:28.978
All right, it's a school
night, everyone go home.

954
01:13:30.122 --> 01:13:32.352
We'll regroup tomorrow.

955
01:13:54.780 --> 01:13:56.179
Hey Randy.

956
01:13:56.248 --> 01:13:58.045
Same to you.

957
01:13:59.051 --> 01:14:01.110
You still got your
eyes on my Buick?

958
01:14:22.274 --> 01:14:25.038
(Mark) Frank, wow,
long time no see.

959
01:14:25.110 --> 01:14:25.906
Good to see you, Mark.

960
01:14:25.978 --> 01:14:27.138
Yeah, what can I do for you?

961
01:14:27.213 --> 01:14:32.173
Ah, I ah, I really
need you to hook me up.

962
01:14:32.251 --> 01:14:33.718
It's for my boy.

963
01:14:34.753 --> 01:14:36.277
Oh wow.

964
01:14:36.355 --> 01:14:38.721
Yeah, he's racing in
the high school drags.

965
01:15:02.581 --> 01:15:04.208
You sold the Buick?

966
01:15:05.618 --> 01:15:06.778
Yep.

967
01:15:09.221 --> 01:15:10.882
Should be enough left
over for the rest

968
01:15:10.956 --> 01:15:13.049
