969
01:15:15.027 --> 01:15:16.927
But, it won you
your first trophy.

970
01:15:19.598 --> 01:15:22.294
Time to let go of the past
and focus on what's ahead.

971
01:15:24.637 --> 01:15:26.264
Thanks, Dad.

972
01:15:27.306 --> 01:15:28.967
It's the least I could do.

973
01:15:31.443 --> 01:15:33.741
Now, help me unload this stuff.

974
01:15:33.812 --> 01:15:37.680
♪ ♪

975
01:15:37.750 --> 01:15:40.913
Right button purges the lines,
left button arms the nitrous.

976
01:15:40.986 --> 01:15:44.422
Kendall's got twice the motor
and a super charger, you got a

977
01:15:44.490 --> 01:15:47.653
200 shot right under your thumb,
light goes green, hit it.

978
01:15:47.726 --> 01:15:50.320
Hold it down the
whole way through.

979
01:15:50.396 --> 01:15:52.728
♪ ♪

980
01:15:54.166 --> 01:15:56.225
Yeah, GT40 manifolds.

981
01:15:56.302 --> 01:15:58.702
Is that the best
price you can give me?

982
01:16:07.146 --> 01:16:08.272
Rocket fuel.

983
01:16:25.998 --> 01:16:28.193
(engine starts)

984
01:16:28.267 --> 01:16:29.495
(applause)

985
01:16:31.070 --> 01:16:32.196
How's it feel?

986
01:16:32.271 --> 01:16:34.762
Feels good, sounds really good.

987
01:16:35.240 --> 01:16:37.936
I have a little surprise.

988
01:16:40.346 --> 01:16:41.643
Don't ask.

989
01:16:50.923 --> 01:16:53.153
I thought it would be good
advertising for the shop.

990
01:16:53.225 --> 01:16:54.590
Yeah, he's thinking
about turning this place

991
01:16:54.660 --> 01:16:56.389
