01:17:33.499 --> 01:17:36.866
Leading the pack, is Bradford
High School with six entries.

998
01:17:36.935 --> 01:17:40.268
Keep your eyes on hometown
favorite, Jake Kendall, and the

999
01:17:40.339 --> 01:17:42.705
whole gang from Kendall
Performance Centers.

