1011
01:18:42.868 --> 01:18:45.860
11.22 and 11.41.

1012
01:18:45.938 --> 01:18:48.338
I've seen both these cars run
quicker, so I don't think

1013
01:18:48.407 --> 01:18:50.705
they're giving it
all they've got.

1014
01:18:52.111 --> 01:18:54.136
You're going down, Kruger.

1015
01:18:55.080 --> 01:18:57.048
