1016
01:18:57.116 --> 01:18:59.744
Like father, like son.

1017
01:19:01.086 --> 01:19:03.384
Looks like you picked
the wrong team, Jess.

1018
01:19:03.455 --> 01:19:05.548
Looks like I picked
the wrong friend.

1019
01:19:06.525 --> 01:19:09.756
(Frank) All right, turn him out. You got to
