1020
01:19:10.729 --> 01:19:11.627
Here.

1021
01:19:12.264 --> 01:19:13.458
We're good to go.

1022
01:19:13.532 --> 01:19:15.124
Fantastic.

1023
01:19:15.200 --> 01:19:17.327
All right, let's get your
ass to the starting line.

1024
01:19:17.402 --> 01:19:19.097
