1025
01:19:19.171 --> 01:19:22.231
First run, all you have to
do is come under 13 seconds.

1026
01:19:22.307 --> 01:19:23.706
That should be no problem.

1027
01:19:23.776 --> 01:19:24.834
Okay.

1028
01:19:29.848 --> 01:19:32.840
(announcer) This is the last race of the
warm-up round and we

1029
01:19:32.918 --> 01:19:35.978
have Danny Kruger and his STl.
His opponent is Alex Dodd in

1030
01:19:36.054 --> 01:19:39.615
his retro Ford Mustang from
Washington High School.

1031
01:19:43.862 --> 01:19:47.229
Look at that burnout. Dodd is
getting those tires nice and

1032
01:19:47.299 --> 01:19:50.462
sticky so he can get maximum
traction off the starting line.

